# Term equivalences for the places domain — GMEOW authoring source.
# Compiled to mappings/gmeow-places.sssom.tsv by `gmeow compile-mappings`.

gmeow:mapsetPlaces a gmeow:MappingSet ;
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-places.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:setId "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mappings/places" ;
    gmeow:license "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" ;
    gmeow:setComment "Location alignments for comprehensive geo interop — schema.org, GeoSPARQL, GeoNames, Getty (gvp), Wikidata, WGS84, vCard, BOT, ifcOWL, IVOA, UAT, SWEET, IEEE 1872-2015 CORA, KnowRob, SOMA, FALDO, Sequence Ontology. placeType/storageMedium/celestialObjectType/sequenceFeatureType are value individuals aligned (closeMatch) to external classes/feature-codes; address components align to schema.org + vCard for lossless round-trip; containedInPlace aligns to the topological \"within\"/parent relations of every geo vocab. StorageLocation/Location/storage* and authorityLink are canonical (no faithful external term). Coreference of place INSTANCES to gazetteer records is done in data with skos:exactMatch + gmeow:authorityLink (Wikidata as hub), not here. Added (stream-to-trajectory design): Stream → sta:Datastream; LocationState → sta:HistoricalLocation + sosa:Sample; Trajectory → sta:Datastream. Added: indoor realm bridging to BOT (Zone/Site/Building/Storey/Space, containsZone, adjacentZone) and ifcOWL (IfcBuilding/IfcBuildingStorey/IfcSpace/IfcSite) by reference. Added (celestial-frame design): CelestialLocation / CelestialCoordinates bridging to IVOA refframe/refposition/object-type, UAT, and SWEET. IVOA timescale alignments live in temporal.ttl. Added (robotic-frame design): Robotic realm bridging to IEEE 1872-2015 CORA (Robot, RoboticSystem), KnowRob (SemanticEnvironmentMap, RobotBaseTrajectory, Joint, FrameOfReference), and SOMA (ArtificialAgent). Added (biological-sequence design): Biological-sequence realm bridging to FALDO (Region, begin, end, ForwardStrandPosition, ReverseStrandPosition, reference), Sequence Ontology (sequence_feature, gene, exon, intron, CDS, SNP, chromosome), and Wikidata (GRCh38, genomic location, sense/antisense strand). Added (geocoding design): Geocode and geocoding ReferenceFrames (Plus Code, what3words, geohash, MGRS, UN/LOCODE, mile-marker) aligned to Wikidata QIDs. Added (spatial-measurement design): SpatialMeasurement / CoordinateObservation bridging to GeoSPARQL geo:Feature and schema.org GeoCoordinates. Added (cadastral design): Cadastral / land-administration realm bridging to ISO 19152 LADM (LA_SpatialUnit, LA_RRR, LA_Party, LA_BoundaryFace) and INSPIRE Cadastral Parcels (CadastralParcel, CadastralBoundary, CadastralZoning, BasicPropertyUnit, nationalCadastralReference) by reference. Added (vertical/maritime/aviation-zone design): Maritime / aviation zones aligned to MRGID ontology (direct), AIXM / UNCLOS / IHO S-100 via Wikidata hub; vertical-dimension reference frames (altitude MSL, flight level, AGL, depth MSL, chart datum).".

gmeow:VirtualLocation skos:closeMatch schema:VirtualLocation {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-places.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.9
|} .

