    gmeow:comment "KnowRob SemanticEnvironmentMap is a robot-built map of the environment; GMEOW referenceFrameRobotSLAM is the reference frame in which such a map is expressed. The alignment is related because both are robot-centric spatial representations with probabilistic occupancy semantics, but a map and a reference frame are different ontological categories."
|} .

gmeow:Trajectory skos:broadMatch knowrob:RobotBaseTrajectory {|
